[
    {
        "text": "Depending on the game, players can earn rewards by interacting with the game world, completing tasks, battling with other players, or building structures on their plot of land. Taking a page from Defi, some games also let players generate passive income without playing the game, either through staking or lending their gaming assets to other players. At the core of gamefi projects, Play to Earn is a revolutionary and financially attractive model for people who play games. It gives players complete control and ownership over their in game assets, while offering opportunities to turn game assets into financial ones. It's different from the pay to Play model adopted by traditional video games. Pay to Play requires gamers to invest before they can start playing. For example, some video games require players to purchase licenses or pay subscriptions.",
